        "identifier": "https://isa-afp.org/entries/Nash_Equilibrium.html",
        "note": "Prior Isabelle formalization of pure and mixed finite Nash equilibria. The Lean development changes the definitions and proof architecture, separates generalized from standard ordinal potentials, and adds the explicit improvement-path interface. The current mixed layer also formalizes the finite support/Dirac and analytic setup and proves the final mixed-Nash existence theorem through an attributed product-simplex Brouwer development.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.6092/issn.1972-5787/7235",
